`StoredToken` from its raw components, taking `time_valid_until` as a `crate::Instant` parameter and building the struct with the provided fields.\n\nI need to place these five implementations in their appropriate locations throughout the file: `set_pn_enc_from_secret` near the existing `set_aead_from_secret` function, `setup_cleartext_aead_salt` in the initial-secret section, `tls_get_negotiated_alpn` and `tls_get_sni` in the `impl Connection` block around line 961, and `format_token` near the existing `format_ticket` function.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2880,"cache_read_input_tokens":78248,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2880},"output_tokens":32,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9b264549-cec3-4800-9d6a-f061bc9f44d5","uuid":"886b2192-699b-4776-8a27-a264bef2fb08"}
